# Alternating branches of the small-model reduction

These extensions construct the actual exceptional A₇ block quotient action,
prove the source [Z₀,K]=U identity for all short blocks, and apply the action
through both ambient and checked quotients for the single-three-cycle marking.

The covered-A₆ marked normalizer, the ordinary-A₇ replacement by an A₆
subgroup, and the full exceptional-A₇ actor classification remain independent
geometric obligations. Final assembly stays here and then feeds
`SourceSmallModels`; this module does not yet prove those three source branches.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined 1 March 2004 manuscript, Lemma 13.6.22,
printed pp.932–933.
-/
